e is Krabs. Haven’t blinked since wave 12. My family’s concerned. I just tell them: \"I am the crab now.\" (They don't understand it)\n\nWeapons? YES.\nMovement? Smoother than butter on a Slip’N Slide.\nEnemies? Somewhere between nightmare fuel and a seafood platter.\n(Pro tip: crank the Doom soundtrack and ascend.)\n\nFinal verdict:\n10/10. This game taught me that sideways movement is a lifestyle.\n\n🦀🔫🦀🔫🦀 [b] IT'S TIME TO CRAB CHAMPION [/b] 🦀🔫🦀🔫🦀", "timestamp_created": 1745357958, "timestamp_updated": 1745357981, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193365451", "author": {"steamid": "76561198207204799", "personaname": "InfiniteRuke", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198207204799/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 6198, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2469, "last_played": 1786326235, "avatar": "ff33c06177b2b7c6e6539da8eb2d0d884ba8594a"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is honestly one of the best games I've played in years. \nJust a genuinely good game and way more fun with friends and just relax", "timestamp_created": 1745356084, "timestamp_updated": 1760243379, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "193361870", "author": {"steamid": "76561199213619414", "personaname": "soba_boi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199213619414/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6,